title: PACKAGE
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Erika
    family-names: Cui
    email: meiying.cui@yale.edu
    affiliation: Yale University
repository-code: 'https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/PACKAGE'
abstract: >-
  PACKAGE is a modular Python framework for single-molecule epigenomic analysis
  of long-read Fiber-seq data from Oxford Nanopore and PacBio platforms. It provides
  HDF5-backed storage with spatial indexing and analytical modules for methylation
  entropy, nucleosome heterogeneity, and co-occurrence analysis at single-molecule
  resolution.
keywords:
  - fiber-seq
  - long-read sequencing
  - single-molecule epigenomics
  - chromatin accessibility
  - nucleosome positioning
  - dna methylation
license: MIT
